    "title": "GPC Viewing Guide: Week 4 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Cole Carmody ,\n21 hours ago Here is a preview of what GPC will be watching ahead of Kansas State's game against Cincinnati. Kansas State and Cincinnati are set for a 6 p.m. kick at Nippert Stadium on Saturday night. The first road game of the season for the Wildcats, it also provides the first time fans will be able to watch the game from home and enjoy the entire Saturday slate. With the game kicking off in the evening, GPC's Ryan Gilbert will be in attendance to provide boots on the ground coverage with the rest of the staff working from home. Read full article",
